<section class="section"><div class="container article-body">
<h2>What's in the DQ $7 Meal Deal — Complete Breakdown</h2>
  <p>The <strong>$7 Meal Deal</strong> is available all day at participating DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations and is the best-value full meal on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>. Here is exactly what you get:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Entree (your choice)</strong> — Original Cheeseburger (400 cal, $6.39 alone) OR 3-Piece Chicken Strip Basket (~700 cal, varies alone)</li>
    <li><strong>Regular Fries</strong> — Medium-sized seasoned fries (~260–370 cal, $2.49+ alone)</li>
    <li><strong>Soft Drink</strong> — Medium Coca-Cola product (~150–200 cal, $2.11+ alone)</li>
    <li><strong>Small Sundae</strong> — Your choice of Hot Fudge, Strawberry, or Caramel (~280–310 cal, $3.79 alone)</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How Much Does the $7 Meal Deal Save You?</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Individual Price</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Original Cheeseburger</td><td class="price-cell">$6.39</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Regular Fries (small)</td><td class="price-cell">$2.49</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Soft Drink (medium)</td><td class="price-cell">$2.11</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Small Hot Fudge Sundae</td><td class="price-cell">$3.79</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Total if ordered individually</strong></td><td class="price-cell"><strong>~$14.78</strong></td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>$7 Meal Deal price</strong></td><td class="price-cell"><strong>$7.00</strong></td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Savings</strong></td><td class="price-cell"><strong>~$7.78</strong></td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h2>Cheeseburger vs. Chicken Strips — Which Entree to Choose?</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Original Cheeseburger</strong> — Classic, lighter (400 cal). The better choice if you want a satisfying but not overly heavy meal. Also lets you add a dessert without feeling overfull.</li>
    <li><strong>3-Piece Chicken Strip Basket</strong> — More protein, slightly more calories. Better if you are hungry and want the heartier option. Note that the basket version in the meal deal is 3 pieces, not the full 4-piece basket sold separately.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Is the $7 Meal Deal Available All Day?</h2>
  <p>Yes. Unlike some fast-food value deals that are limited to lunch hours, the DQ $7 Meal Deal is available all day at participating locations. It applies to dine-in, takeout, and drive-through orders.</p>
