    <h2>Tips for Getting Maximum Value from the $7 Meal Deal</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Always verify at your location:</strong> The $7 Meal Deal is available at participating DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations. Not every location has it at the same price or with the same eligible items.</li>
      <li><strong>Choose the Strawberry Sundae for fewer calories:</strong> The dessert component can be Hot Fudge, <a href="/items/strawberry-sundae">Strawberry</a>, or <a href="/items/caramel-sundae">Caramel Sundae</a>. At 280 cal, the Strawberry Sundae is the lightest option.</li>
      <li><strong>Compare with the <a href="/items/2-for-5-mix-match">2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match</a>:</strong> If you want only two items, the 2-for-$5 is better. If you want four items (a full meal with dessert), the $7 Meal Deal saves significantly more.</li>
